{
  "segments": [
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 1,
      "start_sec": 0.0,
      "duration_sec": 6.14,
      "end_sec": 6.14,
      "word_count": 18,
      "voice_register": "neutral",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.0,
      "text": "In 1977, Ford knew the Pinto's fuel tank ruptured in rear-end collisions. They had the crash test data."
    },
    {
      "type": "pause",
      "start_sec": 6.14,
      "duration_sec": 0.2
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 2,
      "start_sec": 6.34,
      "duration_sec": 7.534,
      "end_sec": 13.874,
      "word_count": 22,
      "voice_register": "neutral",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.2,
      "text": "Two engineers wrote a cost-benefit analysis \u2014 an actual document, with actual numbers. Fix every Pinto: one hundred and thirty-seven million dollars."
    },
    {
      "type": "pause",
      "start_sec": 13.874,
      "duration_sec": 0.2
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 3,
      "start_sec": 14.074,
      "duration_sec": 4.086,
      "end_sec": 18.16,
      "word_count": 12,
      "voice_register": "neutral",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.2,
      "text": "Expected wrongful death payouts: forty-nine point five million. They shipped the car."
    },
    {
      "type": "pause",
      "start_sec": 18.16,
      "duration_sec": 0.2
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 4,
      "start_sec": 18.36,
      "duration_sec": 7.507,
      "end_sec": 25.867,
      "word_count": 22,
      "voice_register": "neutral",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.2,
      "text": "A thirteen-year-old boy named Richard Grimshaw was a passenger in a Pinto that was rear-ended in San Bernardino. The fuel tank ruptured."
    },
    {
      "type": "pause",
      "start_sec": 25.867,
      "duration_sec": 0.2
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 5,
      "start_sec": 26.067,
      "duration_sec": 6.472,
      "end_sec": 32.539,
      "word_count": 19,
      "voice_register": "neutral",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.2,
      "text": "The driver burned to death. Richard survived \u2014 barely. Burned over his entire body. Lost parts of his fingers."
    },
    {
      "type": "pause",
      "start_sec": 32.539,
      "duration_sec": 0.2
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 6,
      "start_sec": 32.739,
      "duration_sec": 4.76,
      "end_sec": 37.499,
      "word_count": 14,
      "voice_register": "neutral",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.2,
      "text": "Lost his left ear. Years of skin grafts. A childhood replaced by hospital rooms."
    },
    {
      "type": "pause",
      "start_sec": 37.499,
      "duration_sec": 0.2
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 7,
      "start_sec": 37.699,
      "duration_sec": 6.135,
      "end_sec": 43.834,
      "word_count": 18,
      "voice_register": "neutral",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.2,
      "text": "The jury awarded one hundred and twenty-five million dollars in punitive damages \u2014 the largest in American history."
    },
    {
      "type": "pause",
      "start_sec": 43.834,
      "duration_sec": 0.2
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 8,
      "start_sec": 44.034,
      "duration_sec": 6.821,
      "end_sec": 50.855,
      "word_count": 20,
      "voice_register": "neutral",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.2,
      "text": "The judge reduced it to three point five million. Ford was acquitted of criminal homicide. No executive went to prison."
    },
    {
      "type": "pause",
      "start_sec": 50.855,
      "duration_sec": 0.2
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 9,
      "start_sec": 51.055,
      "duration_sec": 5.793,
      "end_sec": 56.849,
      "word_count": 17,
      "voice_register": "neutral",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.2,
      "text": "The fine was three point five million dollars. Ford kept selling cars. No one went to prison."
    },
    {
      "type": "pause",
      "start_sec": 56.849,
      "duration_sec": 0.2
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 10,
      "start_sec": 57.049,
      "duration_sec": 2.72,
      "end_sec": 59.768,
      "word_count": 8,
      "voice_register": "neutral",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.2,
      "text": "And somewhere in a boardroom, someone noticed something."
    },
    {
      "type": "pause",
      "start_sec": 59.768,
      "duration_sec": 0.2
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 11,
      "start_sec": 59.968,
      "duration_sec": 5.093,
      "end_sec": 65.061,
      "word_count": 15,
      "voice_register": "neutral",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.2,
      "text": "The cost of getting caught was less than the cost of doing the right thing."
    },
    {
      "type": "pause",
      "start_sec": 65.061,
      "duration_sec": 0.3
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 12,
      "start_sec": 65.361,
      "duration_sec": 6.456,
      "end_sec": 71.817,
      "word_count": 19,
      "voice_register": "neutral",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.3,
      "text": "That might have been an isolated scandal. A single bad company making a single bad calculation. Except it wasn't."
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 13,
      "start_sec": 71.817,
      "duration_sec": 4.981,
      "end_sec": 76.799,
      "word_count": 16,
      "voice_register": "tense",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.0,
      "text": "In 2010, a twenty-four-year-old bank teller named Yesenia Guitron did something dangerous. She told the truth."
    },
    {
      "type": "pause",
      "start_sec": 76.799,
      "duration_sec": 0.2
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 14,
      "start_sec": 76.999,
      "duration_sec": 7.863,
      "end_sec": 84.862,
      "word_count": 23,
      "voice_register": "tense",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.2,
      "text": "She'd watched her colleagues at Wells Fargo open accounts that customers never asked for \u2014 credit cards ordered to addresses that didn't exist"
    },
    {
      "type": "pause",
      "start_sec": 84.862,
      "duration_sec": 0.2
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 15,
      "start_sec": 85.062,
      "duration_sec": 5.807,
      "end_sec": 90.868,
      "word_count": 17,
      "voice_register": "tense",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.2,
      "text": "savings accounts funded by moving money between other accounts without permission. She knew why they did it."
    },
    {
      "type": "pause",
      "start_sec": 90.868,
      "duration_sec": 0.2
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 16,
      "start_sec": 91.068,
      "duration_sec": 7.178,
      "end_sec": 98.246,
      "word_count": 21,
      "voice_register": "tense",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.2,
      "text": "There was a quota: every customer should have eight products. \"Eight is Great.\" Miss the number and you get a warning."
    },
    {
      "type": "pause",
      "start_sec": 98.246,
      "duration_sec": 0.2
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 17,
      "start_sec": 98.446,
      "duration_sec": 5.465,
      "end_sec": 103.911,
      "word_count": 16,
      "voice_register": "tense",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.2,
      "text": "Miss it again and you get fired. So the tellers cheated. Because the alternative was unemployment."
    },
    {
      "type": "pause",
      "start_sec": 103.911,
      "duration_sec": 0.2
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 18,
      "start_sec": 104.111,
      "duration_sec": 5.807,
      "end_sec": 109.918,
      "word_count": 17,
      "voice_register": "tense",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.2,
      "text": "Yesenia called the company's ethics hotline and reported the fraud. Wells Fargo terminated her the same week."
    },
    {
      "type": "pause",
      "start_sec": 109.918,
      "duration_sec": 0.2
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 19,
      "start_sec": 110.118,
      "duration_sec": 2.724,
      "end_sec": 112.842,
      "word_count": 8,
      "voice_register": "tense",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.2,
      "text": "She never found steady work in banking again."
    },
    {
      "type": "pause",
      "start_sec": 112.842,
      "duration_sec": 0.2
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 20,
      "start_sec": 113.042,
      "duration_sec": 5.46,
      "end_sec": 118.501,
      "word_count": 16,
      "voice_register": "tense",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.2,
      "text": "Her name went on an industry blacklist \u2014 a record that follows you like a scar."
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 21,
      "start_sec": 118.501,
      "duration_sec": 5.115,
      "end_sec": 123.616,
      "word_count": 15,
      "voice_register": "neutral",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.0,
      "text": "Three point five million fake accounts. Five thousand three hundred tellers fired for opening them."
    },
    {
      "type": "pause",
      "start_sec": 123.616,
      "duration_sec": 0.2
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 22,
      "start_sec": 123.816,
      "duration_sec": 3.389,
      "end_sec": 127.205,
      "word_count": 10,
      "voice_register": "neutral",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.2,
      "text": "And the woman who designed the quota \u2014 Carrie Tolstedt"
    },
    {
      "type": "pause",
      "start_sec": 127.205,
      "duration_sec": 0.2
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 23,
      "start_sec": 127.405,
      "duration_sec": 6.818,
      "end_sec": 134.223,
      "word_count": 20,
      "voice_register": "neutral",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.2,
      "text": "head of Community Banking \u2014 kept fifty-seven million dollars and got zero prison time. She served her sentence at home."
    },
    {
      "type": "pause",
      "start_sec": 134.223,
      "duration_sec": 0.2
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 24,
      "start_sec": 134.423,
      "duration_sec": 6.477,
      "end_sec": 140.9,
      "word_count": 19,
      "voice_register": "neutral",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.2,
      "text": "Ford's formula required a memo. Wells Fargo's didn't even require a decision \u2014 just a number and a threat."
    },
    {
      "type": "pause",
      "start_sec": 140.9,
      "duration_sec": 0.2
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 25,
      "start_sec": 141.1,
      "duration_sec": 6.478,
      "end_sec": 147.578,
      "word_count": 19,
      "voice_register": "neutral",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.2,
      "text": "Ford needed a document to do this. Wells Fargo only needed a quota. The next company didn't need either."
    },
    {
      "type": "pause",
      "start_sec": 147.578,
      "duration_sec": 0.2
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 26,
      "start_sec": 147.778,
      "duration_sec": 2.017,
      "end_sec": 149.795,
      "word_count": 6,
      "voice_register": "neutral",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.2,
      "text": "It just needed a head start."
    },
    {
      "type": "pause",
      "start_sec": 149.795,
      "duration_sec": 0.2
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 27,
      "start_sec": 149.995,
      "duration_sec": 8.53,
      "end_sec": 158.525,
      "word_count": 25,
      "voice_register": "neutral",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.2,
      "text": "Purdue Pharma saw the lawsuits coming a decade early and withdrew ten point seven billion dollars from the company before anyone could calculate the fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "pause",
      "start_sec": 158.525,
      "duration_sec": 0.2
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 28,
      "start_sec": 158.725,
      "duration_sec": 3.749,
      "end_sec": 162.474,
      "word_count": 11,
      "voice_register": "neutral",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.2,
      "text": "Richard Sackler promised a, quote, blizzard of prescriptions at OxyContin's launch."
    },
    {
      "type": "pause",
      "start_sec": 162.474,
      "duration_sec": 0.2
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 29,
      "start_sec": 162.674,
      "duration_sec": 6.838,
      "end_sec": 169.512,
      "word_count": 20,
      "voice_register": "neutral",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.2,
      "text": "In Kermit, West Virginia \u2014 population four hundred \u2014 a single pharmacy received nine million opioid pills in two years."
    },
    {
      "type": "pause",
      "start_sec": 169.512,
      "duration_sec": 0.2
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 30,
      "start_sec": 169.712,
      "duration_sec": 5.794,
      "end_sec": 175.506,
      "word_count": 17,
      "voice_register": "neutral",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.2,
      "text": "The pharmacist went to prison. The Sacklers moved their money. More than eight hundred thousand Americans died."
    },
    {
      "type": "pause",
      "start_sec": 175.506,
      "duration_sec": 0.2
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 31,
      "start_sec": 175.706,
      "duration_sec": 5.814,
      "end_sec": 181.52,
      "word_count": 17,
      "voice_register": "neutral",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.2,
      "text": "The settlement: seven point four billion. The family's remaining fortune: thirteen billion. Nine thousand dollars per death."
    },
    {
      "type": "pause",
      "start_sec": 181.52,
      "duration_sec": 0.2
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 32,
      "start_sec": 181.72,
      "duration_sec": 6.136,
      "end_sec": 187.855,
      "word_count": 18,
      "voice_register": "neutral",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.2,
      "text": "Ford valued a life at two hundred thousand in 1977. The Sacklers got it down to nine thousand."
    },
    {
      "type": "pause",
      "start_sec": 187.855,
      "duration_sec": 1.5
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 33,
      "start_sec": 189.355,
      "duration_sec": 3.768,
      "end_sec": 193.123,
      "word_count": 11,
      "voice_register": "tense",
      "pause_before_sec": 1.5,
      "text": "The fine is cheaper than the profit. Every time. Without exception."
    },
    {
      "type": "pause",
      "start_sec": 193.123,
      "duration_sec": 0.3
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 34,
      "start_sec": 193.423,
      "duration_sec": 3.063,
      "end_sec": 196.486,
      "word_count": 9,
      "voice_register": "tense",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.3,
      "text": "The law doesn't prevent corporate crime. It prices it."
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 35,
      "start_sec": 196.486,
      "duration_sec": 1.678,
      "end_sec": 198.164,
      "word_count": 5,
      "voice_register": "neutral",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.0,
      "text": "And the price keeps dropping."
    },
    {
      "type": "pause",
      "start_sec": 198.164,
      "duration_sec": 0.2
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 36,
      "start_sec": 198.364,
      "duration_sec": 6.153,
      "end_sec": 204.518,
      "word_count": 18,
      "voice_register": "neutral",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.2,
      "text": "Since 2000, corporations have paid over one trillion dollars in fines and settlements in the United States alone."
    },
    {
      "type": "pause",
      "start_sec": 204.518,
      "duration_sec": 0.2
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 37,
      "start_sec": 204.718,
      "duration_sec": 4.076,
      "end_sec": 208.793,
      "word_count": 12,
      "voice_register": "neutral",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.2,
      "text": "One hundred and twenty-seven companies have each paid more than a billion."
    },
    {
      "type": "pause",
      "start_sec": 208.793,
      "duration_sec": 0.2
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 38,
      "start_sec": 208.993,
      "duration_sec": 9.542,
      "end_sec": 218.536,
      "word_count": 28,
      "voice_register": "neutral",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.2,
      "text": "And here's the number that should end every argument about whether the system works: companies caught repeatedly pay smaller fines as a percentage of their revenue over time."
    },
    {
      "type": "pause",
      "start_sec": 218.536,
      "duration_sec": 0.2
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 39,
      "start_sec": 218.736,
      "duration_sec": 7.161,
      "end_sec": 225.896,
      "word_count": 21,
      "voice_register": "neutral",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.2,
      "text": "Not larger. Smaller. The more you violate, the better the deal gets. Each company added one feature to the original calculation."
    },
    {
      "type": "pause",
      "start_sec": 225.896,
      "duration_sec": 0.2
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 40,
      "start_sec": 226.096,
      "duration_sec": 5.135,
      "end_sec": 231.232,
      "word_count": 15,
      "voice_register": "neutral",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.2,
      "text": "Ford added a memo. Wells Fargo added plausible deniability. Purdue added preemption. Facebook added scale."
    },
    {
      "type": "pause",
      "start_sec": 231.232,
      "duration_sec": 0.2
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 41,
      "start_sec": 231.432,
      "duration_sec": 6.437,
      "end_sec": 237.869,
      "word_count": 19,
      "voice_register": "neutral",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.2,
      "text": "But every one of them had something in common \u2014 the damage, at least in theory, could be reversed."
    },
    {
      "type": "pause",
      "start_sec": 237.869,
      "duration_sec": 0.2
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 42,
      "start_sec": 238.069,
      "duration_sec": 5.786,
      "end_sec": 243.855,
      "word_count": 17,
      "voice_register": "neutral",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.2,
      "text": "Ford could recall the car. Wells Fargo could close the accounts. Purdue could stop making the pills."
    },
    {
      "type": "pause",
      "start_sec": 243.855,
      "duration_sec": 0.2
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 43,
      "start_sec": 244.055,
      "duration_sec": 3.74,
      "end_sec": 247.794,
      "word_count": 11,
      "voice_register": "neutral",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.2,
      "text": "Then the formula met the internet. And the damage became permanent."
    },
    {
      "type": "pause",
      "start_sec": 247.794,
      "duration_sec": 1.5
    }
  ],
  "total_duration_sec": 249.294,
  "out": "audio/breaking_law/chapters/voice_ch1_the_formula.wav",
